   9 | -f | Lexical ascending sort on the specified field names.
  10 | -r | Lexical descending sort on the specified field names.
  11 | -c | Case-folded lexical ascending sort on the specified field na
  12 | -cr | Case-folded lexical descending sort on the specified field n
  14 | -n | Numerical ascending sort on the specified field names; nulls
  16 | -nf | Same as -n.
  17 | -nr | Numerical descending sort on the specified field names; null
  19 | -t | Natural ascending sort on the specified field names.
  20 | -b | Move sort fields to start of record, as in reorder -b.
  21 | -tr, -rt | Natural descending sort on the specified field names.
  22 | -h, --help | Show this message.
